          "value": {
            "type": "str",
            "value": "Refusal row (the stale-table hazard): the live suffix REBINDS a\nprefix-bound module global a function body reads. CPython makes `z = z + 41`\na module global, so readz() answers 42; leanpy's suffix bindings land in\nthe script's locals, invisible to function frames, so running this would\nanswer a stale 1 \u2014 `suffixConsistent` refuses the whole script loudly."
          }
